2026-02-23  Savitoj Singh <savsingh@redhat.com>

	* Version 3.1
	* Auto-freeze packages on every deactivate
	* Backup & restore for laptop migration (setv backup / setv restore)
	* Doctor & rebuild for broken envs after OS Python upgrades
	* Freeze command (setv freeze) for manual package export
	* Temporary environments (setv --tmp), auto-deleted on deactivate
	* Run without activate (setv --run myenv -- command)
	* Auto-activate on cd via .setv file (setv --init)
	* Braille dot spinner for long operations
	* Improved help with colored sections
	* Test suite for bash and zsh (60 tests)
	* GitHub Actions CI workflow
	* Fixed set -u (nounset) compatibility throughout
	* Fixed compdef availability check for non-interactive zsh

